  caseFiles:
  - title: Case Notes
    body: "\u2022 While browsing, a full-screen red page appeared and started beeping.\n\u2022
      One minute before this email arrived, you clicked \"Forgot password\" on NovaCloud
      yourself. Trusted domain (case files): novacloud.example"
  - title: How This Room Works
    body: 'Six questions are waiting in this room. They arrive one at a time, in
      a different order on every attempt.


      Case questions have four answer
      choices, shuffled each attempt. Pick the safest and most accurate one.


      Messages
      and web pages are judged as SCAM or LEGITIMATE.


      Score 550 or more to
      unlock the next room.'
  firstMessageDelay: 8
  delayBetweenMessages: {x: 10, y: 20}
  minimumActivityDelay: 4
  scoring:
    basePoints: 150
    speedBonus: 15
    fastWindow: 0.35
    wrongPenalty: 25
    recoveryPoints: 40
    baseReadingSeconds: 20
    secondsPerWord: 0.5
    secondsPerDetail: 3
    minReadingSeconds: 40
    maxReadingSeconds: 120
    caseExtraSeconds: 60
    overtimeStepSeconds: 15
    overtimePenaltyPerStep: 5
    maxTimePenalty: 30
    minCorrectPoints: 120
  oneStarScore: 375
  twoStarScore: 550
  threeStarScore: 900
  minScoreToUnlockNext: 550
  nextLevelId: level_3
  nextSceneName: Room3_DigitalTrap
  lessons:
  - Check whether a request for personal data is proportional and explained before
    handing it over.
  - Value accounts by what else they unlock.
  - Know where real security alerts and updates come from.
  - Preserve and document evidence before doing anything else.
  - 'Avoid "everything is a scam" thinking: confirm real messages with evidence.'
  - Find the real domain in a URL by reading right to left.
  learningSummary: 
  performanceHigh: Excellent investigation! You identified the key warning signs
    and made efficient decisions.
  performanceModerate: Good work. Review the explanations to sharpen your judgment
    and improve your response time.
  performanceLow: Keep learning. Examine sender identity, context, urgency, and requests
    for sensitive information before deciding.
